#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0086 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: A variable is present with the same name as a variable present in ADSL but the variables do not have identical formats
#note "No ADSL in the study: the label probe $adsl_label has no value, the not empty($adsl_label) gate folds false, and the format comparison is never reached. Pins the absent-ADSL disposition of the cross-dataset probe."
dataset ADLBC class=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col TRTSDT type=Num format=DATE9.
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | 22000
---
